		{
			title: "装备信息"
			x: -9.75d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "这到底是怎么回事？What Is Up With It?"
			description: [
				"&d行啦，强盗，给你快速介绍一下&n&lVault Gear及其属性&r&d。"
				""
				"&5所有Vault Gear的数值都分为&n&l三类词缀：内嵌、前缀和后缀&r&5。每件装备都有一定数量的&n&l这些词缀&r&5，通常&n&l取决于稀有度&r&5。"
				""
				"&d&n&lImplicits are the base stats&r&d of a piece. &n&lArmor always has Armor, Weapons always have Damage&r&d in their list of implicits. Some Implicit slots can be a number of things, like &n&lBlock OR Thorns on shields&r&d, but usually never both at the same time... at least as an Implicit."
				""
				"&5&n&lPrefixes and Suffixes are the various bonus stats&r&5 a piece of gear has, and are much &n&leasier to reroll than Implicits&r&5 are. They can be anything from &n&lextra armor or damage, more mana, better looting, or even special abilities&r&5 like causing a Poison or Frost nova to happen when you hit an enemy."
				""
				"&d哦，强盗！&n&l如果一个齿轮部件能提升某个已列出的能力，你至少需要1点该能力&r&d才能使用它！"
			]
			dependencies: ["5E574242513BE343"]
			id: "739D201BBF702013"
			tasks: [{
				id: "66DE3B2D8804617F"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
		}
